{"title":"1998 AHSME Problems/Problem 12","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1998_AHSME_Problems/Problem_12&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>How many different prime numbers are factors of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/c/9/fc97ef67268cd4e91bacdf12b8901d7036c9a056.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$N$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"18\" height=\"14\" /> if\n</p>\n<center><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/e/2/3e299a9c249c24f7ece706fabc28efdbb48b77cd.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\log_2 ( \\log_3 ( \\log_5 (\\log_ 7 N))) = 11?$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"239\" height=\"20\" /></center>\n<p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/e/2/3e2e4d5c916859632b7625f8f14bb758bd36cafa.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\mathrm{(A) \\ }1 \\qquad \\mathrm{(B) \\ }2 \\qquad \\mathrm{(C) \\ }3 \\qquad \\mathrm{(D) \\ } 4\\qquad \\mathrm{(E) \\ }7$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"344\" height=\"20\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1998_AHSME_Problems/Problem_12&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Re-writing as exponents, we have <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/c/f/7cf3279463306211ebea9c4aa2b35497ff3b4468.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\log_3 ( \\log_5 (\\log_ 7 N)) = 2^{11}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"186\" height=\"19\" />, and so forth, such that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/6/b/96b10a7d000b01a2903199d848d77d9feb8e4510.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$N = 7^{5^{3^{2^{11}}}}$\" width=\"78\" height=\"25\" />, which only has <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/0/a/e0a0db32027a732ac57d37ef2ae9bb150f65b108.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$7$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> as a prime factor <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/8/6/f86c831cd0853eaa72f84e71632f05991401a344.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\mathbf{(A)}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"28\" height=\"18\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_also\">See also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1998_AHSME_Problems/Problem_12&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: See also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1998_AHSME\" title=\"1998 AHSME\">1998 AHSME</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1998_AHSME_Problems\" title=\"1998 AHSME Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1998_AHSME_Answer_Key\" title=\"1998 AHSME Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/Forum/resources.php?c=182&amp;cid=44&amp;year=1998\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1998_AHSME_Problems/Problem_11\" title=\"1998 AHSME Problems/Problem 11\">Problem 11</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1998_AHSME_Problems/Problem_13\" title=\"1998 AHSME Problems/Problem 13\">Problem 13</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?tit